/-!
Finite spectral arithmetic behind the weighted marginal-spectrum theorem.
The link from matrices to these hypotheses (ordered eigenvalue monotonicity
and the singular-value trace inequality) is mathematical, not axiomatized.
In particular, no hypothesis below asserts the final upper bound.
